===Verb===
{{head|en|verb|phrasal verb|head=to [[bang]] up}}

# To [[damage]].
#: ''He '''banged up''' his new car last night''.
# To put someone in [[prison]].
#: ''He was so drunk that the police '''banged''' him '''up''' for the night.''

